    "site is checked against.",
    "",
    "This small tree exists so tests/cli-examples' must-trip and must-pass",
    "fixtures state their own expectations instead of inheriting whatever the",
    "CLI happens to look like the day they are run. It mirrors the released",
    "tree's shape for the paths the fixtures use: kubenest backup restore is",
    "registered and NOT available (the skeleton annotation in",
    "kubenest-cli/pkg/cmd/backup.go), every other path here is available, and",
    "no flag here is inherited because no command in the released CLI has a",
    "persistent flag yet.",
    "",
    "scripts/selftest_cli_examples.py FAILS when a fixture stops matching this",
    "tree (a must-pass fixture using a flag that is not here, or a must-trip",
    "fixture that no longer trips), so an edit to this file is visible."
